---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About FitnessCalculator - Free Online Fitness Calculators" 
  description="Learn about FitnessCalculator: Free fitness calculators for BMI, TDEE, calorie intake, body fat, macros, weight loss, and health metrics."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-3 sm:px-4 md:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-black dark:text-white">About FitnessCalculator</h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mb-8">FitnessCalculator is your comprehensive platform for free fitness and health calculations. Whether you're starting a weight loss journey, building muscle, or simply monitoring your health metrics, our collection of advanced calculators provides instant, science-backed results.</p>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111] p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">📊 Science-Based Calculations</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60">All our fitness calculators use evidence-based medical and fitness formulas for accurate results.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111] p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">🔒 100% Private</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60">Your data never leaves your device. No tracking, no accounts, no data collection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111] p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">⚡ Instant Results</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60">Get your fitness metrics instantly. No loading times, just fast calculations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111] p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-3">📱 Works Everywhere</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60">Fully responsive design works perfectly on mobile, tablet, and desktop devices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111] p-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-4">Popular Calculations</h3>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-2">Weight Loss & Calories</h4>
            <ul class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 space-y-1">
              <li>• Calorie calculator for weight loss</li>
              <li>• Calorie deficit calculator</li>
              <li>• Daily calorie intake calculator</li>
              <li>• Calories burned calculator</li>
              <li>• Calorie maintenance calculator</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-2">Body Metrics</h4>
            <ul class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 space-y-1">
              <li>• BMI calculator</li>
              <li>• Body fat percentage calculator</li>
              <li>• Ideal weight calculator</li>
              <li>• Lean body mass calculator</li>
              <li>• Body measurement calculator</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-2">Nutrition & Energy</h4>
            <ul class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 space-y-1">
              <li>• TDEE calculator</li>
              <li>• BMR calculator</li>
              <li>• Macro calculator</li>
              <li>• Protein calculator</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-2">Health & Fitness</h4>
            <ul class="text-sm text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 space-y-1">
              <li>• Water intake calculator</li>
              <li>• Heart rate calculator</li>
              <li>• Weight loss calculator</li>
              <li>• Calorie counter</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a fitness calculator?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A fitness calculator is a tool that helps you calculate fitness and health metrics like BMI, calories needed, body fat percentage, and more using your personal information."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I calculate calories to lose weight?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Use our calorie calculator to find your daily calorie needs, then create a calorie deficit by consuming fewer calories than needed. Our calorie deficit calculator helps determine the right amount."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a healthy BMI?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A healthy BMI range is typically 18.5 to 24.9. Use our BMI calculator to check yours and compare against healthy BMI charts."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much protein should I eat per day?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Protein needs vary by body weight and fitness goals. Use our protein calculator to determine how much protein per day you need."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>